Yes, see if he began donating right after
Vasudha Devi passed away,

1003
01:03:16.292 --> 01:03:17.958
or if it's only been
for the past couple of months...

1004
01:03:18.042 --> 01:03:19.083
Yes, sir.

1005
01:03:19.167 --> 01:03:20.917
