- ACP.

1006
01:03:21.000 --> 01:03:23.958
Assistant Commissioner of Police
Bhavani Singh.

1007
01:03:25.875 --> 01:03:27.667
Now, you may leave, my lord.

1008
01:03:29.167 --> 01:03:30.792
Men like me,

1009
