he starts his workout with?</i>

1097
01:10:20.792 --> 01:10:21.833
<i>Bench press, sir.</i>

1098
01:10:22.167 --> 01:10:26.208
<i>So, if it weren't a Sunday
and he wasn't working on his upper body,</i>

1099
01:10:26.750 --> 01:10:28.750
<i>the plan wouldn't have worked.</i>

1100
01:10:29.208 --> 01:10:30.792
<i>So what does that tell us?</i>

1101
01:10:32.000 --> 01:10:34.500
