1215
01:20:01.000 --> 01:20:02.500
Put your phone on silent!

1216
01:20:02.833 --> 01:20:04.250
Where is that Warden Rakesh?

1217
01:20:05.583 --> 01:20:07.458
Leo used to speak very highly of him.

1218
01:20:08.917 --> 01:20:11.000
